## 🔧 **Critical Fixes Needed**

### 1. **JavaScript Conflict in View Files**
**Problem**: You have duplicate JavaScript files with different implementations:
- `assets/js/ebook-offer-view.js` (uses `style.display`)
- `blocks/ebook-offer/view.js` (uses `classList.toggle`)

**Fix**: Use consistent approach (CSS classes are better):

```javascript
// blocks/ebook-offer/view.js - CORRECTED
(function(){
  const $$ = (s, c=document)=>Array.from(c.querySelectorAll(s));
  $$('.at-ebook-offer').forEach(root=>{
    const mode = root.dataset.mode || 'rotate';
    const interval = parseInt(root.dataset.interval||'7000',10);
    const items = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll('.at-ebook-item'));

    if (mode === 'single' || items.length < 2) {
      items.forEach((it, idx)=>it.classList.toggle('is-active', idx===0));
      return;
    }

    let i = 0;
    items.forEach((it,idx)=> it.classList.toggle('is-active', idx===0));

    setInterval(()=>{
      items[i].classList.remove('is-active');
      i = (i + 1) % items.length;
      items[i].classList.add('is-active');
    }, interval);
  });
})();
```

