Now I can see the issue! The problem is in your CSS - **the menu styling is incomplete**. You have CSS classes defined (like `.main-navigation`) but your HTML is using different classes (like `.nav-container` and `#primary-menu`).

## **The Problem:**

Your HTML uses:
```html
<nav id="site-navigation" class="nav-container default menu-pos-below_header">
  <ul id="primary-menu" class="primary-menu">
```

But your CSS only styles:
```css
.main-navigation { /* This doesn't match your HTML */ }
```

