/* ===== HEADER IMAGE STYLES ===== */

/* Header Background Image Styles */
.header-background-image {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: var(--header-image-height, 300px);
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    z-index: 1;
    opacity: var(--header-image-opacity, 0.8);
}

.header-image-background .site-header {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    min-height: var(--header-image-height, 300px);
}

.header-image-background .header-container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
}

/* Ensure content stays above background */
.header-image-background .site-branding,
.header-image-background .main-navigation {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 4;
}

/* Above header image style */
.header-image-above .header-background-image {
    position: relative;
    height: var(--header-image-height, 300px);
}

.header-image-above .header-container {
    position: static;
}

/* Adjust header container height when using background image */
.header-image-background .header-container {
    min-height: var(--header-image-height, 300px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
}

🎯 What This CSS Does:

    Proper Background Positioning - Header image stays behind logo/menu

    Flexible Height Control - Uses your customizer height setting

    Z-index Layering - Ensures content stays above the background

    Background Cover - Image scales properly to fill the space

    Opacity Control - Uses your customizer opacity setting

